  close | @ · attach a file or image
  close | Ctrl+V · paste an image | From the system clipboard, as [image #N]
  close | / · slash commands
  close | Ctrl+R · search sent messages | Ctrl+R for older, Enter keeps, Esc restores
  close | Ctrl+A/E · Ctrl+U/K/W · Ctrl+Y · Ctrl+- | Line start/end, kill to start/end/word, yank, undo; Alt+B/F words
  close | !command · run a shell command | Same approval, sandbox and danger check
  close | Ctrl+C · stop, clear, then leave | Stops a running turn, else clears text; twice on empty leaves. Work continues.
